# copy-file : copy a file from one DirCap/path to another DirCap/path
# Copies Cargo.toml to target/ and verifies the copy exists
[copy-file %pwd "Cargo.toml" [narrow %pwd "target"] "tinct-test-copy-file.toml"]
---
%
[call $exists [narrow %pwd "target"] "tinct-test-copy-file.toml"]
=== out
Bool(true)
